OL,3,ADaniel Thomas pleads not guilty after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to criminal damage
OL,8,Fafter a video appeared to show him
OL,9,Fslashing at a dinghy in the Channel
OL,10,Fwith a knife.
OL,12,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,13,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, was arrested
OL,14,Fafter the livestreamed video on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FThomas, who appeared at Basingstoke
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court in Hampshire via
OL,19,Fvideolink, is also charged with failing
OL,20,Fto disclose the PIN to his phone.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
